{"id":2335,"name":"parseCSV","kind":64,"kindString":"Function","flags":{},"children":[],"sources":[{"fileName":"packages/node-utils/src/data/index.ts","fullFileName":"/home/runner/work/fe-tools/fe-tools/utils/packages/node-utils/src/data/index.ts","line":23,"character":16,"url":"https://github.com/MichealWayne/fe-tools/blob/9c1268f/utils/packages/node-utils/src/data/index.ts#L23"}],"signatures":[{"id":2336,"name":"parseCSV","kind":4096,"kindString":"Call signature","flags":{},"comment":{"summary":[],"blockTags":[{"tag":"@function","content":[{"kind":"text","text":"parseCSV"}]},{"tag":"@description","content":[{"kind":"text","text":"解析CSV字符串为二维数组。Parses CSV string to 2D array"}]},{"tag":"@returns","content":[{"kind":"text","text":"二维数组。2D array"}]},{"tag":"@remarks","content":[{"kind":"text","text":"支持单字符分隔符、双引号转义、CRLF 和引号内换行；字段会 trim，纯空白记录会被丢弃。This parser supports a single-character delimiter, escaped double quotes, CRLF, and newlines inside quoted fields. Fields are trimmed and blank records are discarded, while a quoted empty field is preserved."}]},{"tag":"@example","content":[{"kind":"code","text":"```ts\nconst csv = 'name,age,city\\nJohn,25,NYC\\nJane,30,LA';\nconst data = parseCSV(csv);\n// -> [['name', 'age', 'city'], ['John', '25', 'NYC'], ['Jane', '30', 'LA']]\n```"}]}]},"parameters":[{"id":2337,"name":"csv","kind":32768,"kindString":"Parameter","flags":{},"comment":{"summary":[{"kind":"text","text":"CSV字符串。CSV string"}]},"type":{"type":"intrinsic","name":"string"},"text":{"comment":"<p>CSV字符串。CSV string</p>\n"}},{"id":2338,"name":"delimiter","kind":32768,"kindString":"Parameter","flags":{},"comment":{"summary":[{"kind":"text","text":"单字符分隔符(默认: ',')。Single-character delimiter (default: ',')"}]},"type":{"type":"intrinsic","name":"string"},"defaultValue":"','","text":{"comment":"<p>单字符分隔符(默认: &#39;,&#39;)。Single-character delimiter (default: &#39;,&#39;)</p>\n"}}],"type":{"type":"array","elementType":{"type":"array","elementType":{"type":"intrinsic","name":"string"}}},"is":{"declaration":false},"location":{"query":"node-utils/src.Function.parseCSV","hash":"parseCSV"},"text":{"comment":"<h5>Function:</h5><p>parseCSV</p>\n<h5>Description:</h5><p>解析CSV字符串为二维数组。Parses CSV string to 2D array</p>\n<h5>Returns:</h5><p>二维数组。2D array</p>\n<h5>Remarks:</h5><p>支持单字符分隔符、双引号转义、CRLF 和引号内换行；字段会 trim，纯空白记录会被丢弃。This parser supports a single-character delimiter, escaped double quotes, CRLF, and newlines inside quoted fields. Fields are trimmed and blank records are discarded, while a quoted empty field is preserved.</p>\n<h5>Example:</h5><pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"pl-k\">const</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">csv</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>name,age,city<span class=\"pl-cce\">\\n</span>John,25,NYC<span class=\"pl-cce\">\\n</span>Jane,30,LA<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>;\n<span class=\"pl-k\">const</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">data</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-en\">parseCSV</span>(<span class=\"pl-smi\">csv</span>);\n<span class=\"pl-c\">// -> [['name', 'age', 'city'], ['John', '25', 'NYC'], ['Jane', '30', 'LA']]</span>\n</code></pre>\n"},"sources":[{"fileName":"packages/node-utils/src/data/index.ts","fullFileName":"/home/runner/work/fe-tools/fe-tools/utils/packages/node-utils/src/data/index.ts","line":23,"character":0,"url":"https://github.com/MichealWayne/fe-tools/blob/9c1268f/utils/packages/node-utils/src/data/index.ts#L23"}],"parentId":2335}],"is":{"declaration":true},"location":{"query":"node-utils/src.Function.parseCSV","hash":""},"text":{},"parentId":965}
